{"id":"hdel.1","n":"hdel","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"hfsutils","ver":"3.2.6-15build2","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/h/hfsutils/hfsutils_3.2.6-15build2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/hdel.1.gz","sha256":"485ae2ae28914c223b4d10983ebb2274d48fae3af65341635f4d7e04691c68a9","date":"05-Apr-1996","origin":"HFSUTILS"}},"nopt":{"u":0},"desc":"delete both forks of an HFS file","u":[["NAME","<p>hdel - delete both forks of an HFS file</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p>hdel <i>hfs-path</i> [...]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>hdel</b> deletes files from the current HFS volume. Both forks (resource and data) of each named file are removed, freeing space for other files.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>hfsutils(1), hrmdir(1)</p>"],["FILES","<p>$HOME/.hcwd</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Robert Leslie &lt;rob@mars.org&gt;</p>"]]}